Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.89,0:00:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.01,0:00:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.97,0:01:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,so what will it be mortal are you\Ngoing to hand mokuba over willingly
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.09,0:01:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,or do i have to conjure something\Nto consume your soul forget
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.17,0:01:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,it no way you know that i have\Nthe power to back up my threats
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.41,0:01:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,hand him over this instant or i'll\Ndispatch you to the graveyard too
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.47,0:01:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.25,0:01:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Your evil power comes from\Nthat, the Millennium Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.37,0:01:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.33,0:01:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Ring not only allows\Nme to control your friend by Kur,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.09,0:01:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,it gives me many other\Nmagical abilities as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.97,0:01:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So unless you want a more personal\Ndemonstration of my power,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.35,0:01:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll stop resisting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.97,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you know any attempt\Nwould be pointless,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.81,0:01:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,why sacrifice yourself when you know I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.99,0:01:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,still wind up in possession\Nof him in the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.51,0:01:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.97,0:01:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.51,0:01:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.05,0:02:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, think fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.63,0:02:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the evil spirit inside that\Nnecklace is what's controlling Bakura,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.21,0:02:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to get rid of the necklace.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.41,0:02:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So long, evil spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.09,0:02:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And this time, don't come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.73,0:02:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Good riddance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.41,0:02:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I will defeat you in one\Nrealm or another, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.39,0:02:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.51,0:02:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.37,0:02:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He's sealing us in another dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.53,0:02:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutting me off from my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.91,0:02:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd they go, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.79,0:02:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.89,0:02:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This is really spooky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.25,0:02:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we help Yuki when\Nwe can't even see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.83,0:02:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, how about a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.35,0:03:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.13,0:03:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.53,0:03:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had an adventure and a half today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.71,0:03:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, what happened to those two?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.49,0:03:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That evil spirit took over Bakura again,\Nand even though I got rid of it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.19,0:03:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.10,0:03:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.47,0:03:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.63,0:03:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I freed Mokuba, but then\NBakura tried to grab him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.65,0:03:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he want with Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.65,0:03:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Details, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.09,0:03:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He wanted Mokuba for his new host body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.53,0:03:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I handled it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.61,0:03:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's history.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.09,0:03:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal with\Nthe indoor thunderstorm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.03,0:03:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.93,0:03:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,These two should be\Nall right here for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.11,0:03:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go down and check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.69,0:03:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Pronto.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.87,0:03:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus was losing, and he started\Nranting something about a shadow game,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.25,0:03:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and an instinct came out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.89,0:03:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they're still inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.15,0:03:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.79,0:03:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This place always gives me the creeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.23,0:03:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever Pegasus brings me\Nhere, it only means one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.79,0:03:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,A Shadow Game.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.23,0:04:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll find your experience\Nin the Shadow Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.51,0:04:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,this time around will be a\Nlot harder than your last.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.23,0:04:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The strain of maintaining\Nyour mind shuffle will make it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.35,0:04:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,more difficult for you to\Nmentally conjure up your monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.71,0:04:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.91,0:04:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.13,0:04:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take over, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.29,0:04:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'm strong enough,\Nso let's finish our duel now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.79,0:04:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be safer if you let\Nme handle Pegasus, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.95,0:04:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I can survive in this\Nrealm easier than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.93,0:04:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But we can't abandon our strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.81,0:04:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the only thing keeping\NPegasus from reading our minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.15,0:04:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, and it's the only\Nreason we have our narrow lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.81,0:04:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,For my next brilliant move, I play my\NDark Eyes Illusionist in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.29,0:04:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.71,0:04:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a monster I created\Njust for this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.93,0:04:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't forget, in this\Nrealm, it's as real as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.63,0:04:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.15,0:05:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know he looks formidable, but what\Nsort of a threat could he be to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.53,0:05:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He has zero attack points\Nand zero defense points.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.01,0:05:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.99,0:05:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,since it's a monster you've\Nnever seen before today,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.43,0:05:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,you have no way of knowing\Nits hidden secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.79,0:05:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have been known to keep a few\Ntricks up my sleeve from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.17,0:05:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.05,0:05:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what secrets your\Ndark eyes illusionist holds,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.41,0:05:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm certain it's not as harmless\Nas you would like me to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.37,0:05:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's quite dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.69,0:05:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you're so suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.73,0:05:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll lay my curse of dragon on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.33,0:05:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon, come forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.55,0:06:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to keep Pegasus off balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.91,0:06:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to keep switching our minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.97,0:06:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.21,0:06:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Yu-Gi overestimates\Nhis mental prowess and
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.07,0:06:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,underestimates the burden of\Nfighting a duel in the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.61,0:06:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think you have\Nit in you, Yugi boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.03,0:06:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You now have two creatures to maintain,\NYour Curse of Dragon and your Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.45,0:06:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.13,0:06:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The string, it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.39,0:06:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like nothing I've ever felt before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.41,0:06:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole world is spinning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.27,0:06:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, if this is too much for\Nyou, you should let me take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.61,0:06:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.29,0:06:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to try to last out the turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.47,0:06:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He's too young and unskilled\Nto cope with the stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.57,0:06:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and communicating with that other spirit\Nsplits his concentration even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.47,0:06:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,His mental and magical energies\Nwill soon be exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.33,0:06:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You felt it too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.27,0:07:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sharp jolt, right in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.63,0:07:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Along with the strangest feeling that\Nsomething bad has happened to Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.25,0:07:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me about it, Téa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.77,0:07:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that our little\Nbuddy's in big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.29,0:07:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.27,0:07:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You felt it too? Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.33,0:07:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe it's because we've\Nall become so tight,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.49,0:07:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's like we've developed\Nsome kind of weird link with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.73,0:07:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.17,0:07:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but if we're feeling what he's\Nfeeling, it must be really bad in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.25,0:07:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If only there was some\Nway we could help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.73,0:07:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're looking a little pale, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.29,0:07:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should give up\Nyour mindshuffle strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.45,0:07:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a breather.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.85,0:07:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I can send you back to your world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.11,0:07:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Anytime you're ready to surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.85,0:07:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, for once, Pegasus\Nis telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.85,0:07:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mind just can't handle the\Nstress of maintaining our monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.25,0:07:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, take over. For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.41,0:07:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use my turn to attack\Nwith Curse of Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.29,0:08:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,An impulsive attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.53,0:08:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Precipitated, no doubt, by\Nhis concern for little Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.83,0:08:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But in his rush, he's\Nmade a fatal mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.31,0:08:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Your attack activates Dark Eye's\NIllusionist's special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.63,0:08:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mesmerizing magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.45,0:08:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He stopped him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.97,0:08:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,To make up for Dark Eye's non-existent\Nattack and defense points.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.85,0:08:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I endowed him with a special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.63,0:08:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Eye's Illusionist can\Nuse the power of its mesmeric
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.07,0:08:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,eye to paralyze attacking\Nmonsters in their tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.45,0:08:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,With such a superb monster at my disposal,\Nwhat could my next brilliant move be?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.17,0:08:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Just play it. As you\Nwish. Believe it or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.47,0:08:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to use the Black Illusion Ritual
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.67,0:08:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Card to sacrifice my incredible Dark Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.55,0:08:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Has he gone insane, you might ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.71,0:08:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Sacrificing a creature that can\Nparalyze any monster I play?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.15,0:08:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm merely using this ceremony\Nto create an even better monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.53,0:09:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I hereby sacrifice Dark-Eyed Illusionist\Nto summon another Spellcaster monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.09,0:09:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, there's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.29,0:09:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The incredible, extraordinary,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.25,0:09:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,unforgettable creature\Nknown only as Relinquished.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.65,0:09:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite a looker, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.29,0:09:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of monster can this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.55,0:09:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.11,0:09:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you by activating\Nits special power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.31,0:09:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's even more irresistible\Nthan my previous creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.05,0:09:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.55,0:09:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My curse of dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.79,0:09:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Gone, but not forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.83,0:09:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician, go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.05,0:09:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack Relinquished!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.73,0:09:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magic Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.21,0:09:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Relinquished, activate\Nyour defense shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.65,0:10:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's using my captured Curse of\NDragon as a shield against the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.01,0:10:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dark Magician's attack eliminates\NCurse of Dragon from the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.53,0:10:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But since he was your creature,\Nyou lose the life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.37,0:10:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,By absorbing its opponent's monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.05,0:10:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Relinquished can use them\Nand their attack and defense
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.01,0:10:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,points to protect against\Nany attacking monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.83,0:10:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, relinquished remains unharmed\Nwhile the opponent suffers the damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.51,0:10:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Your own attack reduced your life point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.17,0:10:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I have relinquished in\Nplay, you're your own worst enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.07,0:10:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, how frustrating it must be to be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.91,0:10:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,To know you have all these\Ngreat monsters in your deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.49,0:10:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you dare play any of them,\Nthey will be used against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.09,0:10:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This game's not over yet, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.85,0:10:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but it might as well be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.37,0:10:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My monster's unstoppable. Watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.43,0:11:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate Relinquished's\NHypnotic Attraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.95,0:11:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Try as he might to resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.81,0:11:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dark magician will find my spellcaster\Nas irresistible as your dragon did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.21,0:11:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Like your dragon, he'll soon be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.69,0:11:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No, my dark magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.59,0:11:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It captured him, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.45,0:11:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's turned him\Ninto another defense shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.11,0:11:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.65,0:11:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're beginning to catch on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.29,0:11:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And this time, I've got one of your most\Npowerful monsters to use against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.77,0:11:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention your personal favorite,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.19,0:11:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,but in an attack, he'll take\Nyour light points all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.63,0:11:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess you're not his\Nfavorite. Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.75,0:11:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I possibly win?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.39,0:11:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Any monster I use will\Nbe turned against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.83,0:12:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And even if I come up with another\Nstrategy, Pegasus will know it instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.81,0:12:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.07,0:12:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to mind shuffle\Nagain long enough for me to
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.57,0:12:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,play a card and retreat before\NPegasus can read my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.33,0:12:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.79,0:12:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll work again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.15,0:12:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're up to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.07,0:12:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know how long you\Ncan last in the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.99,0:12:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have to last long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.71,0:12:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Just long enough to pull one last card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.05,0:12:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you reach the limits of your\Nendurance, your soul will be shredded,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.69,0:12:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,dispersed in the Shadow\NRealm for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.43,0:12:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever the risk, I have to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.45,0:12:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,For Grandpa's sake, we both have\Nto trust in the heart of the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.19,0:12:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.10,0:12:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to play fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.49,0:12:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a little Yugi. He's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.75,0:12:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Some people never learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.81,0:12:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to have faith in the heart of\Nthe cards, because the next card I pull...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.23,0:12:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,might be my last!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.97,0:13:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, make it one\Nthat can defeat Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.67,0:13:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.43,0:13:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,it's all up to the\Nspirit of the millennium
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.65,0:13:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,puzzle now pegasus i\Nplay one card face down
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.63,0:13:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and for my last move i throw\Nferal imp in defense mode
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.35,0:13:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,at least now there's one card that pegasus
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.41,0:13:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't know about now\Nmaybe we stand a chance
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.19,0:13:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If I try to eat his mind,\Nthey'll just switch again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.53,0:13:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So instead, I'll overtax it like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.23,0:13:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Relinquish, prepare to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.39,0:13:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Use the Dark Magician's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.67,0:13:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Slifer, power attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.41,0:13:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy the Feral Imp.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.57,0:13:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The Feral Imp!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.81,0:13:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, switch now. Quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.97,0:13:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.71,0:13:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi! Spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.95,0:13:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to beat Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.53,0:14:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,One down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.49,0:14:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.57,0:14:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Something happened to Yugi just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.05,0:14:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.01,0:14:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it was, it felt devastating.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.69,0:14:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He's hurt, or worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.35,0:14:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi! Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.69,0:14:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't sense his spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.63,0:14:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I can no longer feel the presence\Nof his young mind. No. He...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.19,0:14:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,he can't be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.99,0:14:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.07,0:14:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy was too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.93,0:14:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It takes a person of\Ntrue fortitude to cope
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.79,0:14:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,with the harsh unrealities\Nof the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.39,0:14:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Face it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.30,0:14:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi is gone and it's just you and me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.77,0:14:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This is too freaky. Suddenly I'm not\Nfeeling Yugi at all. It's like he's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.55,0:15:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,vanished off the face of the planet i\Nknow what could have happened to him
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.49,0:15:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.65,0:15:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,telling you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.56,0:15:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm getting creeped
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.47,0:15:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,out one minute i was feeling yugi like
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.99,0:15:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,he was right here beside me and then\Nthe next he was gone i felt it too
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.87,0:15:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.78,0:15:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to get to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.33,0:15:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs our help. Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.51,0:15:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, adult!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.13,0:15:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.01,0:15:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.79,0:15:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So what'll we do now? Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.41,0:15:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's got to be some way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.83,0:15:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.27,0:15:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.99,0:15:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yell if you can hear us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.53,0:15:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow I just passed through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.23,0:15:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened? No good, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.87,0:15:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever this dome bubble thingy is,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.61,0:16:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,it's clear Pegasus designed it\Nto keep Yugi in and us outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.87,0:16:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't believe our\Nbest friend's in the worst
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.35,0:16:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,jam ever and there's nothing\Nwe can do to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.61,0:16:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.83,0:16:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can\Nget through to help Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.75,0:16:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it feels like it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.57,0:16:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You used your underhanded\Ntactics to overwhelm Yugi's mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.65,0:16:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You will pay for what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.87,0:16:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So I take it from this\Nemotional outburst that
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.69,0:16:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,you're having a difficult\Ntime acknowledging
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.45,0:16:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,the fact that you failed\Nin your self-appointed
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.09,0:16:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,duty to protect your\Nlittle dueling protégé.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.27,0:16:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever you are, perhaps Yugi would have\Nbeen better off without your interference.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.43,0:16:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Be silent!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.09,0:16:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,For what you have done,\NI will show you no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.79,0:16:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let the game continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.11,0:16:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.61,0:16:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You no longer have Yugi to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.95,0:17:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Once more, your mind\Nis an open book to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.07,0:17:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The card you drew is Winged Dragon and\NGuardian of the Fortress, a weak monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.45,0:17:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Without Yugi, he can't stop me\Nfrom reading his mind any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.93,0:17:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus read my mind, so now he\Nknows all the cards in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.93,0:17:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The only card he doesn't know is\Nthe one Yugi left on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.95,0:17:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have no way of knowing if that's a\Ncard that could tip the duel in my favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.59,0:17:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Winged Dragon in Defense Mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.45,0:17:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.31,0:17:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroying your defense monster\Nwon't affect your life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.21,0:17:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'll do it just for fun. Relinquish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.25,0:17:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy the Winged Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.53,0:17:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.45,0:17:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, the card of your final\Ndefeat. Your time's run out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.67,0:18:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Jigen Bakudan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.47,0:18:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The infamous time bomb.\NYes, Jigen Bakudan is a self
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.11,0:18:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-destructing monster that's immune\Nto attacks In just two turns,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.03,0:18:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,it will explode and destroy\Nmy beloved Relinquished.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.13,0:18:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're using Bakudan to\Ndestroy your own monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.55,0:18:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but more importantly, it'll also\Ndestroy the ones Relinquished has absorbed,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.81,0:18:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,namely yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.83,0:18:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And Relinquished?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.19,0:18:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,His attack power is zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.21,0:18:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Meaning your life points won't\Nbe affected at all, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.91,0:18:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.15,0:18:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,While my score is unaffected, the\Nexplosion will wipe out the Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.71,0:18:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And his attack points will be deducted\Ndirectly from your life points Ending
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.87,0:18:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,the game And that'll destroy any hope\NI have of rescuing Yugi's grandfather,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.37,0:18:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba and Mokuba. Face it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.09,0:18:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,the clock is ticking down on your\Ndemise And there's nothing you can do to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.91,0:18:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,stop it I just can't remember the last\Noccasion I had so much fun Remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.71,0:19:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,only two turns left till\Nkaboom And you don't have a
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.05,0:19:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,single card in your hand that\Ncan help you Trust me, I know
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.85,0:19:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.79,0:19:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I draw a new card,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.85,0:19:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus' Millennium Eye will let him read
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.11,0:19:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,My mind and see exactly\Nwhat card I've drawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.05,0:19:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.29,0:19:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I can read your mind, you\Ncan do nothing against me. You've lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.81,0:19:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,the game is over
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.53,0:19:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.71,0:19:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,As much as I hate to admit it,\NI've failed. I failed Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.51,0:19:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and I failed all of his friends\NNothing I draw can help me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.89,0:19:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki's sacrifice was in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.73,0:19:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,His grandpa and the Kaiba\Nbrothers are doomed.
